<svg class="figure-wide" viewBox="0 0 660 424" role="img" aria-label="Who watches whom. The prober mails when a check has no result for three intervals. The page Worker asks the prober to watch its last run every minute and mails when probing stalls or the prober does not answer. A daily digest goes out, and a missing digest is the alarm when both Workers are dead. An outside poller can read the status API." xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
